---
layout: layouts/page.njk
title: 회사개요
eyebrow: About Us
lead: 20년 이상의 전문 경력을 바탕으로 IT Service 전문대표기업으로 새롭게 태어났습니다.
section: about
description: (주)트라이얼정보통신의 회사 개요와 핵심 역량을 소개합니다.
---
<section class="section">
  <div class="container">
    <div class="split split--aside">
      <div class="stack-lg">
        <div>
          <p class="section__eyebrow">Greeting</p>
          <h2 class="section__title">정보통신산업의 든든한 기둥</h2>
        </div>
        {%- for paragraph in company.introduction %}
        <p>{{ paragraph }}</p>
        {%- endfor %}
      </div>

      <div class="contact-card">
        <div class="contact-card__row">
          <p class="contact-card__key">Tel</p>
          <p class="contact-card__value">
            <a href="{{ site.contact.tel | telHref }}">{{ site.contact.tel }}</a>
          </p>
        </div>
        <div class="contact-card__row">
          <p class="contact-card__key">E-mail</p>
          <p class="contact-card__value">
            <a href="mailto:{{ site.contact.email }}">{{ site.contact.email }}</a>
          </p>
        </div>
        <div class="contact-card__row">
          <p class="contact-card__key">Address</p>
          <p class="contact-card__value flow-tight">
            {{ site.contact.address1 }}<br>{{ site.contact.address2 }}
          </p>
        </div>
        <p><a class="btn btn--ghost" href="{{ '/contact/' | url }}">오시는 길 보기</a></p>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

<section class="section section--tint">
  <div class="container">
    <div class="section__head">
      <p class="section__eyebrow">Strengths</p>
      <h2 class="section__title">우리가 잘하는 일</h2>
    </div>
    <div class="grid grid--3">
      {%- for item in company.strengths %}
      <div class="feature reveal">
        <p class="feature__icon" aria-hidden="true">{{ loop.index }}</p>
        <h3 class="feature__title">{{ item.title }}</h3>
        <p class="feature__text">{{ item.text }}</p>
      </div>
      {%- endfor %}
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

<section class="section">
  <div class="container">
    <div class="section__head">
      <p class="section__eyebrow">Overview</p>
      <h2 class="section__title">일반 현황</h2>
    </div>
    <dl class="datalist">
      {%- for row in company.overview %}
      <div class="datalist__row">
        <dt class="datalist__key">{{ row.key }}</dt>
        <dd class="datalist__value">{{ row.value }}</dd>
      </div>
      {%- endfor %}
    </dl>
  </div>
</section>
